title: Start
color: red
---
<<declare $likeness = 50>>
<<declare $liked = 0 >>
<<if $liked == 1>>
<<likeness 50>>
<<else>>
<<background "FirstScene">>

Sitting in a class, the teacher is mindlessly talking about gravity and its effects but you can't be bothered to really pay attention.
You're more focused on the girl infront of you. 

<<background "ThirdScene">>

She's got a tube of paper, pressing it to her mouth and staring at the teacher...
She's definetly going to get a spit ball on the teacher...

<<background "Fith">>

That'd honestly be really funny...

<<background "SecondScene">>

If it weren't the fact you needed to make sure your notes were correct for the quiz tommorrow...
Did you really need to stop her? It'd give the class a break...

<<background "Sixth">>

But you're the class president, you can't have this harm your fellow students eductation...
What should you do?

-> Stop her!
    <<likeness -40>>
    <<set $likeness = 10>>
    <<jump Stop_Her>>
-> Wait and see what happens.
    <<likeness 50>>
    <<set $likeness = 100>>
    <<jump Wait>>

   
===

title: Stop_Her
color: blue
---
<<background "Fouth">>

Damn it... letting her do this would only cause more trouble. 

<<background "stim 10">>

You stand up and walk infront of the girl, making the class focus their eyes on you.
You: "Please hand that over..."
Girl: "What?"
You: "You know what I'm talking about."
The teacher had paused her lesson, everyone focused on the two of you. 
Girl: "Tch...Fine."
The girl handed it over, slapping the tube into your palm and rolling her eyes.
Girl: "So lame"
You drop the tube and spitballs into the trash and sit back down.
Teacher: "Thank you for catching that, now back to..."

<<jump End>>
===

title: Wait
color: green 
---
<<background "Stim 9">>

You wait and watch as the spit ball leaves the tube and lands square on the teachers head.
more fly out and hit her square on, sending the class into a fit of laughter.
She screams at the girl and points her out of the classroom, yelling to go to the principal.
The girl shrugs and leaves without a second thought. 
<<jump End>>
===


title: End
color: yellow
---
After class you walk by the principals office, the windows are open and you catch a glimpse inside.

<<if $likeness > 60>>

<<background "stim7">>

The principal is sternly reprimanding the girl, hands on his hips and a finger at her but she's not focused at that at all.
She glances at you, smiling and giving you a small wave, you wave back as you past by. 
the end.

<<elseif $likeness <= 40>>

<<background "Stim8">>

The principal is yelling at that girl from earlier. She isn't looking at him though, instead her eyes are locked on you.
She's glaring right at you...
ugh... better to hope you never have an interaction with her again...

<<else>>

The principal is yelling at that girl from earlier. She doesn't even notice you.

<<endif>>

Play again?
-> Restart
<< Set $liked = 1 >>
<<jump Start>>
===
